{"id":"moda","lemma":"moda","pos":"noun","rank":1523,"glosses":["fashion","fad","mode"],"ipa":"/ˈmoda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"modas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-moda.wav","examples":[{"text":"La moda cambia rápidamente.","en":"Fashions change quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460794","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to change","l":"cambiar"},{"g":"rapidly, quickly"}]},{"text":"Tom no tiene gusto para la moda.","en":"Tom has no sense of style.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806045","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"taste"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ésta es la última moda.","en":"This is the latest fashion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38184","words":[{"g":"this one","l":"éste"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"final","l":"último"},null]},{"text":"Ella siempre se viste a la moda.","en":"She always wears fashionable clothes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538320","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"you know"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Esta clase de vestido ahora está de moda.","en":"That kind of dress is now in fashion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689014","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"lecture"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"dressed"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}